@startuml fs_ops_01_seq_pipeline
skinparam backgroundColor #0F0E17
skinparam defaultFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #A5B4FC
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam sequenceDividerFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam noteBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam noteFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam titleFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #172554
skinparam stateBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam stateFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam stateArrowColor #A5B4FC
title FS-OPS-01 (proposed) — Check, deploy, watch
autonumber "[00]"

actor "Developer" as D #1E1B4B
participant "GitHub" as GH #172554
participant "CI job" as CI #172554
participant "Workers Builds" as WB #172554
participant "Worker\ntomlop-web" as W #052E16
participant "Uptime monitor\nand alerts" as MON #3B0764

== Check ==
D -> GH : push
GH -> CI : run
CI -> CI : typecheck, unit tests, build
CI -> CI : e2e script against wrangler dev with a throwaway local D1
group Any step fails
  CI --> GH : red, deploy blocked
end

== Deploy ==
CI --> WB : green on main
WB -> W : build and deploy
WB -> W : D1 migrations run first, additive only

== Watch ==
MON -> W : GET /library/library.json and /privacy every few minutes
group Not 200 or too slow
  MON --> D : alert by email
end
W -> W : on writes, prune expired OAuth rows, stale rate limits, old revisions
note over D, W
  Monthly: export the database. Quarterly: practise a restore into a scratch database.
end note
@enduml
